join PotatoBuyer center
PotatoBuyer: Do you want to give me a potato?
- Sure! Here!
	if {PlayerItems.potato}  >  0:
		PotatoBuyer: Thanks for the potato!
		do PlayerItems.add_money(1)
		do PlayerItems.del_potato(1)
	else:
		PotatoBuyer: You don't have enough potatoes to spare.
- Can't spare one.
	PotatoBuyer: I like 'em baked. Fried. Hashed. Chopped. Scalloped. Potatoes are the best. Bring me some and I'll be just about as grateful as a kitten fresh out of a tree.
leave PotatoBuyer [animation="Slide Out Right" length="1.0" wait="true"]
